          </svg>`} />
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4 z-10">{t('Customizable')}</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow z-10">
            {t('Koha can be configured in hundreds of ways, which makes it suitable for any type of library. It also supports many open standards and integrates with countless other systems.')}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- The screenshot comes before the row of buttons below it: the page says what Koha is
           (the three cards), then shows the interface itself, and only then offers the two ways
           forward - our hosting service, or a demo instance to try first. It still reads above
           the "Sustainable choice" copy as well; that paragraph is the one about the responsive
           interface, and the figure answers it by showing a desktop and a phone at once. The
           component carries the two renditions, the view switch and the language pair, and the
           hosting page shows the very same figure above its cards. -->
      <div class="mt-20">
        <KohaScreenshot />
      </div>
      <!-- No margin of its own: the figure above ends in `mb-20` and that is the gap this row
           wants. `sm:` puts the two choices side by side as soon as they fit, and wrapping keeps
           a narrow desktop window from pushing them out of the section. -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-4">
        <Button href="#cloud-hosting-service" variant="primary" size="lg" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4 shadow-xl shadow-primary-500/20">
          {t('Koha Cloud Hosting Service')}
        </Button>
        <!-- A demo instance on its own host, for libraries that want to see Koha before they
             talk to us, so this link leaves the site. -->
        <Button href="https://fi-demointra.koha.fi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" variant="outline" size="lg" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4">
          {t('Try Koha for free')}
        </Button>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto pb-32 mt-12 reveal-on-scroll">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
          {t('Sustainable choice')}
        </h2>
          <p class="text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('Koha is a library system that has been in active development since 1999. Backed by thousands of libraries around the world, its community keeps Koha in step with modern standards and technologies. Koha has a responsive interface that works on desktops, tablets and phones, and it connects to other systems through a range of APIs.')}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-10 text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('One of the main strengths of Koha is that nobody "owns" its source code. The GPLv3 licence gives everyone the right to copy and modify the software. Unlike proprietary systems, no vendor can decide that Koha is finished and push a library to buy a new system. Anyone can take a copy of Koha at any time and continue its development. Koha lives as long as its community keeps it going. And there is no sign of that slowing down. That is why we often say Koha will probably be the last library system your library will ever need.')}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<KohaServiceComponent />
<section id="request-a-quote" class="py-32 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-night-soft border-y border-zinc-200 dark:border-night-line relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-zinc-200/50 via-transparent to-transparent dark:from-primary-900/10 dark:via-transparent dark:to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        {t('Request')} <span class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">{t('a quote')}</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
        {t('Free your library from vendor lock-ins and offer a transparent, sustainable service to your patrons. Koha will probably be the last library system your library ever needs.')}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:grid-rows-[minmax(260px,auto)_minmax(280px,auto)] gap-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 reveal-on-scroll" style={formSent ? '' : 'display:none'}>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
          {t('Thank you for submitting your request.')}
        </h2>
        <p style={errors.form ? 'display:none' : ''} class="text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('We will reply to the e-mail address you provided.')}
        </p>
        <p style={errors.form ? '' : 'display:none'} class="text-left text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-sans">
          {t('Unfortunately an error occurred. Please try again later or contact us by post (our address is on the contact page) and include the following error message.')}
        </p>
        <pre style={errors.form ? 'transition-delay: 100ms;' : 'display:none'} class="mt-10 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform shadow-2xl shadow-primary-500/10 reveal-on-scroll overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap">{errors.form}</pre>
      </div>
      {rateLimited && (
        <p role="alert" data-form-rate-limited class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8 text-left text-xl text-red-800 dark:text-red-400">
          {t('Too many submissions from this connection. Please try again later or contact us by post (our address is on the contact page).')}
        </p>
      )}
      <form method="POST" action="#request-a-quote" novalidate data-validate style={formSent && errors.form.length === 0 ? 'display:none': ''} >
        <div class="glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform shadow-2xl shadow-primary-500/10 reveal-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 sm:grid-cols-1 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform" >
            <!-- The section label straddles the top border of its panel. It is centred on the
                 panel and wraps inside it, so it never hangs off the edge of a narrow screen. -->
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Contact information')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Name')}</label><input type="text" name="name" maxlength="120" class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.name} required data-error-message={t('Please enter your name. ')} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            {errors.name && <p class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800">{errors.name}</p>}
            <p id="koha-error-name" class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800" data-error-for="name" hidden></p>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Organization')}</label><input type="text" name="organization" maxlength="120" class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.organization} required data-error-message={t('Please enter your organization. ')} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            {errors.organization && <p class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800">{errors.organization}</p>}
            <p id="koha-error-organization" class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800" data-error-for="organization" hidden></p>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('E-mail')}</label><input type="email" name="email" maxlength="254" class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.email} required data-error-message={t('Please enter an email address. ')} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            <!-- Bot traps: hidden from people and screen readers, but not from scripts. -->
            <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-[-9999px] top-auto h-px w-px overflow-hidden">
              <label>Website<input type="text" name="website" value={formData.website} tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            </div>
            <input type="hidden" name="form_token" value={formToken} />
            {errors.email && <p class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800">{errors.email}</p>}
            <p id="koha-error-email" class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 text-red-800" data-error-for="email" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform mt-10" >
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Catalog and user details')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <h3 class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4">{t('Please enter the number of')}</h3>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Records')}</label><input type="text" name="records" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.records} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Items')}</label><input type="text" name="items" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.items} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Annual circulation')}</label><input type="text" name="circulation" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.circulation} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Patrons')}</label><input type="text" name="patrons" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.patrons} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Librarians')}</label><input type="text" name="librarians" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1"  value={formData.librarians} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform mt-10" >
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Current system')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <label class="p-3 mt-5 col-span-1">{t('Current library system')}</label><input type="text" name="current_ils" maxlength={MAX_SHORT_FIELD_LENGTH} class="form-field mt-5 p-3 col-span-1" value={formData.records} /><div class="md:col-span-2"></div>
        </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform mt-10" >
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Your library')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <p class="col-span-2 mb-3">{t('Describe your library and its daily work. Do not worry about being too formal. Tell us what kind of material your library manages, what types of patrons you serve, what circulation rules you use, what your library building is like and how it affects your shelving locations, and so on.')}</p>
            <p class="col-span-2 mb-3">{t('The more detail you give us, the better we can tailor the Koha configuration for your library.')}</p>
            <p class="col-span-2 mb-3">{t('You can also skip this step.')}</p>
            <textarea name="about_my_library" rows="5" maxlength={MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH} class="form-field p-3 sm:col-span-1 col-span-2">{formData.about_my_library}</textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform mt-10" >
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Additional services and integrations')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <p class="col-span-2 mt-10 lg:mt-3 mb-3">{t('Do you have checkout machines that need to be connected to Koha? Does your library system talk to other systems - for example SSO authentication (Azure/Google/other), mail servers (O365/Gmail/other) for library notifications, or online resources behind authentication?')}</p>
            <p class="col-span-2 mb-3">{t('It is perfectly normal not to need any additional services or integrations, so it is fine to leave this field empty. Koha can for example send notifications without O356/Gmail integration as well.')}</p>
            <p class="col-span-2 mb-3">{t('We ask because integrations take a little more work to set up and sometimes require software development.')}</p>

            <textarea name="additional_services" rows="5" maxlength={MAX_MESSAGE_LENGTH} class="form-field p-3 sm:col-span-1 col-span-2">{formData.additional_services}</textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 glass-panel border-2 border-primary-500 dark:border-primary-500 rounded-1xl p-8 flex flex-col relative transform mt-10" >
            <div class="absolute -top-4 inset-x-4 flex justify-center text-center" data-form-section>
              <Badge variant="primary" class="px-4 py-1.5 font-bold shadow-sm">{t('Ready?')}</Badge> 
            </div>
            <Button type="submit" class="border-2 col-span-2 border-primary-500">{t('Submit')}</Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <FormValidation />
</BaseLayout>
